 75AS c  Compiler's note: The uncertainties reported for several of the         
 75AS2c  electron intensities and conversion coefficients seem too low          
 75AS3c  to be realistic. Also some of the gamma-ray intensities are            
 75AS4c  many times larger than reported by other studies of {+75}Se decay.     
 75AS5c  There also seem other inconsistencies in the level scheme as           
 75AS6c  presented by 2005Ra29, such as feeding of a state within               
 75AS7c  5 keV of the Q(|e) value with a log {Ift} value of 3.2.                
